      "subtopic": "HTTP 方法语义",
      "knowledgePoint": "支持的补丁格式",
      "questionType": "代码与配置",
      "origin": "自行整理",
      "question": "HTTP 响应中的 Accept-Patch 首部表示什么？",
      "answer": "它列出目标资源支持的 PATCH 文档媒体类型。",
      "explanation": "服务器可以在 OPTIONS 响应中提供该信息。",
      "example": "Accept-Patch 列出 application/json-patch+json。",
      "tags": [
        "HTTP 方法语义",
        "支持的补丁格式"
      ],
      "evidence": "source",
      "reference": "https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc5789.html"
